00000070  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  03 00 00 00 03 00 00 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 66 f6 01 00 04 00  00 00 63 28 00 00 01 00  |..f.......c(....|
00000090  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 1f  00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
